A '''bazaar''' was located in [[Nevarro]]'s [[Nevarro City|city]], where merchants sold their wares. A [[Kowakian monkey-lizard]] was roasted on the grill in the bazaar.<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|nevarro-bazaar|Nevarro bazaar}}</ref>

